WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:03.001
A table is rows, and each row is cells

2
00:00:03.779 --> 00:00:06.054
&lt;table&gt; opens the whole table.

3
00:00:06.831 --> 00:00:10.781
&lt;tr&gt; is one row. Each &lt;th&gt; in it is a heading cell.

4
00:00:11.824 --> 00:00:14.899
The next row holds ordinary cells: &lt;td&gt;.

5
00:00:16.454 --> 00:00:18.904
&lt;/table&gt; closes the table.

6
00:00:20.306 --> 00:00:24.981
Columns appear by themselves, so every row needs the same number of cells.
